<section id="local">
<h2>Two-minute local run</h2>
<pre><code>brew install torjan0/tap/cirewind
cirewind demo --out cirewind-demo
cirewind verify cirewind-demo</code></pre>
<p>The demo needs no credential, network access, or repository clone.</p>
